================================================================

Optional integration:

GitHub-connected project can reuse repository metadata.

Core bootstrap must not require GitHub.

================================================================
150. LOCAL REPO FIRST
================================================================

A plain local Git repository must be fully supported.

================================================================
151. PERFORMANCE
================================================================

Measure bootstrap on:

small repo
medium fixture
monorepo fixture

Report scan/index timing.

No fabricated benchmark.

================================================================
152. SCAN CACHE
================================================================

Reuse detection results where repository fingerprint unchanged.

================================================================
153. INCREMENTAL REFRESH
================================================================

Refresh only affected components where possible.

================================================================
154. OBSERVABILITY
================================================================

Track:

bootstrap_runs
bootstrap_failures
baseline_duration
index_duration

No high-cardinality repository names in Prometheus labels.

================================================================
155. AUDIT
================================================================

Audit mutating bootstrap apply.

Read-only local analysis need not create excessive enterprise audit
noise in single-user local mode.

================================================================
156. RELEASE PROFILES
================================================================

Maintain:

CORE_FREE
LOCAL_PRODUCTION_RUNTIME
QUALITY_ENGINEERING
LOCAL_RUNTIME_VERIFIED
LOCAL_CODING_VERIFIED
SELF_HOSTED
SAAS

Add:

PROJECT_BOOTSTRAP
LOCAL_DX_READY

================================================================
157. PROJECT_BOOTSTRAP
================================================================

Requires:

detection
validation discovery
dry-run
config generation
safe apply
baseline
RAG planning
quality profile
readiness

Can PASS without a real local LLM.

================================================================
158. LOCAL_DX_READY
================================================================

Requires:

PROJECT_BOOTSTRAP
local-free profile
zero paid calls
usable first-task workflow
CLI experience
project status/doctor

================================================================
159. REAL_BOOTSTRAP_CODING
================================================================

Optional stronger E4 evidence:

actual model completes first task after bootstrap.

