================================================================
163. README QUICKSTART
================================================================

Make actual first-run flow obvious.

Example:

pip install ...

cd my-project

zcoder init
zcoder init --apply
zcoder run "Fix failing tests"

Do not put paid provider setup before local-free quickstart.

================================================================
164. VERSION DECISION
================================================================

Inspect actual tags/releases.

Do not mechanically keep 1.40.0 forever.

This upgrade materially improves CLI/DX but need not be major if
backward-compatible.

Explain SemVer from actual publication state.

================================================================
165. REQUIRED FINAL COMMANDS
================================================================

Run:

python -m pytest -q -ra

python main.py --version
python -m build

clean wheel install

zcoder --version
zcoder init --help
zcoder doctor project

git diff --check
git status --short

Run separately:

Python bootstrap E2E
Node bootstrap E2E
monorepo E2E
existing-config E2E
dirty-repo E2E
no-local-model E2E
offline bootstrap E2E
zero-paid bootstrap E2E
self-hosted Web bootstrap tests

If real local model exists:

run real bootstrap -> coding E2E separately.

================================================================
166. DEFINITION OF DONE
================================================================

Upgrade-19 is complete only when:

[ ] Upgrade-18 model-quality evidence is truth-audited
[ ] simulated quality cannot be called real measured quality
[ ] confidence/severity fields are semantically correct
[ ] project bootstrap service exists
[ ] init is dry-run safe
[ ] init apply is explicit
[ ] no silent package installation exists
[ ] no silent model download exists
[ ] project stack detection is evidence-backed
[ ] package manager detection is correct
[ ] validator discovery uses real configuration
[ ] CI commands are treated as evidence, not blindly executed
[ ] baseline exists before autonomous modification
[ ] pre-existing failures are recorded
[ ] dirty working tree is handled safely
[ ] AGENTS.md generation is evidence-backed
[ ] existing AGENTS.md is preserved
[ ] project config is versioned
[ ] config merges preserve manual values
[ ] local model recommendation uses real installed state
[ ] no fake model quality is generated
[ ] quality profile bootstraps from actual project
[ ] RAG bootstrap remains secret-safe
[ ] untrusted MCP never auto-enables
[ ] minimal tool plan is generated
[ ] readiness report exists
[ ] monorepos/components work
[ ] bootstrap is resumable/idempotent
[ ] drift is detectable
[ ] local-free profile requires no commercial credentials
[ ] zero-paid bootstrap proves prohibited calls = 0
[ ] first useful workflow is reachable in minimal commands
[ ] inherited tenant/security/runtime/quality gates remain green

